cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use AgentX or its registry data, please cite it as below.
  The platform paper is in preparation; until it is published, citing the
  team's research-agent survey (preferred-citation) is the way to credit
  this work.
title: 'AgentX: Verified Registry of Research AI Agents'
type: software
authors:
  - name: Webioinfo01
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Webioinfo01/agentx-hub'
abstract: >-
  A community registry of scientific research AI agents: a curated
  directory with live GitHub metrics, verified-run reviews from
  researchers, side-by-side comparison and monthly ecosystem reports,
  with a free public API.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - scientific-research
  - registry
  - reviews
license: MPL-2.0
